        <mxCell id="legend" value="Legend / facts&#xa;• Parser (purple): ETF constituents. Needed for matchScore. Fast when cached.&#xa;• Market Data hist (red): 1Y/3Y/5Y + sparkline. DISCOVER cold = three sequential historical-data calls (~7+7.6+8.4s). FULL skips this on DEV image 39066693542.&#xa;• Market Data prices (orange dashed): FULL buy-list LTP only.&#xa;• Vault: ETF_API_URL ← apps/{env}/services/am-parser · MARKET_DATA_API_URL ← apps/{env}/services/am-market-data&#xa;• Code: EtfApiClient.java · EnrichedEtfService.java · EtfPerformanceEnricher.java · BasketPriceResolver.java" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="760" width="800" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="modes" value="DISCOVER vs FULL&#xa;&#xa;DISCOVER: parser holdings + hist&#xa;skip live prices&#xa;skip sector enrich&#xa;slim JSON (no composition)&#xa;&#xa;FULL: parser holdings&#xa;NO hist (DEV 39066693542)&#xa;live prices + overlap ~4s" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="860" y="760" width="380" height="160" as="geometry" />
